'''Spiritomb''' (Japanese: '''ミカルゲ''' ''Mikaruge'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

