===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Spiritomb|89}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*'''Swirling Disaster''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Absol|97}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

